Z||000001||danny boy||05-31-2001||09:53 PM|||| I have Corbeau Forzas in mine. The fit very well, and I used the Fiero sliders. They sit as low if not lower than the Factory seats,though the head(helmet)rest sits much higher and partially blocks rear view. If the seats are all the way back I cannot open the center console, but all the way back is for entering/exiting only anyway. As soon as I get pics I'll post them.<P>------------------<BR>don't push the A/c button.. it catches the car on fire      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PFF_sig_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
